Description:

Formula described by pupukuusikko at the Forums;

http://www.fractalforums.com/the-3d-mandelbulb/a-new-3d-mandelbrot-variant-mandelcup/

This version derives from the JIT version by the way.

Original description;

An uninformed attempt at 3d Mandelbrot, 
Thanks to Tglad, Knighty, DarkBeam and others at Fractalforums.com
Intricate, clean julias around (x=0.1, y=0, z>1), scale>5
3d versions of mandelbrot julias in the inside, shape -1 or 1, Scale > 1
Suggested options;
opts=1,1,0, scale=10, shape=3 (Notre Dame)
opts=1,0,0 scale=1, shape=-1 (2d-mandelbrot)
opts=1,0,1, scale=3, shape=-1 (bottle-liike)